Authorization: Basic technician@company.com:pqr
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "WorkOrderID": "{{pm1.response.body.$.ID}}",
  "OperationID": "{{opsPm.response.body.$.value[0].ID}}",
  "TechnicianID": "{{tech.response.body.$.ID}}",
  "startTime": "2026-11-12T08:00:00Z",
  "stopTime": "2026-11-12T09:00:00Z",
  "workDescription": "Monthly service done",
  "findings": "All normal",
  "meterReading": 1660,
  "markCompleted": true
}


### 8.14 Technician completes the preventive order
